\par 
\par    1- L\'aa Th\'de B\'a8ng T\'a9m- C\'f4c tr\'ad\'ebng C\'f4c Kho b\'b9c Nh\'b5 n\'ad\'edc- Tr\'ad\'ebng ban.
\par    2- \'a7\'c6ng \'a7\'f8c Mai- Tr\'ad\'ebng ph\'dfng vi t\'ddnh C\'f4c KBNN- \'aei\'d2u ph\'e8i vi\'aan
\par    3- L\'aa Tu\'can- Chuy\'aan vi\'aan Ban qu\'b6n l\'fd v\'b5 \'f8ng d\'f4ng tin h\'e4c- Th\'ad k\'fd.
\par    4- Tr\'c7n Quang \'a7\'c8u- Chuy\'aan vi\'aan C\'f4c KBNN- phi\'aan d\'dech. 
